2026-07-27T10:36:29.3643435Z i /tmp/RtmpLvGlQX/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:36:29.3643691Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:36:29.3643977Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:36:29.3644219Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:36:29.3644595Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:36:29.3645123Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:36:29.3645702Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
